  session (issue #339). After every turn, the server's GoalEvaluator
  consumer asks a small fast model whether the condition is met; if so,
  the goal clears and the session goes idle; if not and the queue is
  empty, the evaluator enqueues a follow-up so the loop continues
  without the agent having to remember to re-fire. \`--max-turns\` caps
  the evaluator; \`--expires-at <iso>\` is an absolute hard deadline.
  Set once per loop; re-setting preserves the evaluator's turn count.

